rite cmd /c {input}). Quote arguments with spaces.","kind":"words","label":"Command","ordered":true,"placeholder":"python3 -c {input}","when":{"type":["run","terminal","suggestions"]}},{"id":"stdin","help":"Send the text to standard input (no {input} needed)","kind":"text","label":"Standard input","optional":true,"placeholder":"{input}","when":{"type":["run"]}},{"id":"timeoutSeconds","kind":"number","label":"Stop after (seconds)","max":120,"min":1,"optional":true,"placeholder":"10","step":1,"when":{"type":["run","suggestions"]}},{"id":"ascii","kind":"toggle","label":"Type English letters (for code and paths)","optional":true,"when":{"type":["prompt","run","terminal","link"]}},{"id":"programs","value":"Programs run on this PC: add only commands you wrote and trust. They run only when you press the action key, never in password fields.","kind":"info","label":"","when":{"type":["run","terminal"]}},{"id":"query","help":"What you type after the prefix goes to the program as one argument: where {input} is in the command, else last.","kind":"toggle","label":"Look up as you type (what you type after the prefix goes to the program)","optional":true,"when":{"type":["suggestions"]}},{"id":"queryMinChars","kind":"number","label":"Look up from character","max":32,"min":1,"optional":true,"placeholder":"3","step":1,"when":{"type":["suggestions"]}},{"id":"refresh","value":"1h","choices":[{"value":"5m","label":"Every 5 min"},{"value":"15m","label":"Every 15 min"},{"value":"30m","label":"Every 30 min"},{"value":"1h","label":"Every 1 h"},{"value":"6h","label":"Every 6 h"},{"value":"12h","label":"Every 12 h"},{"value":"1d","label":"Every 1 d"},{"value":"7d","label":"Every 7 d"}],"kind":"choice","label":"Refresh","optional":true,"when":{"type":["suggestions"]}},{"id":"insert","choices":[{"value":{"default":"{arg}"},"label":"Just the match"},{"value":{"default":["{arg} {title}","{arg}"]},"label":"With its title"},{"value":{"chat":["{arg} {title} {url}","{arg} {title}","{arg}"],"default":["{arg} {title}","{arg}"]},"label":"With title and link (in chat apps)"}],"help":"Other templates of your own are written as a plugin's insert, in the config file.","kind":"choice","label":"Insert","optional":true,"when":{"type":["suggestions"]}},{"id":"suggestionsProgram","value":"The program runs on this PC: for its list when you type the prefix (then at the refresh interval), and with Look up as you type with what follows the prefix as one argument, nothing else; never in password fields. Add only programs you wrote and trust.","help":"Run with no input, it prints every item: a line each, \"match⇥title⇥url\" (title and url optional), or the plugins' JSON.","kind":"info","label":"","when":{"type":["suggestions"]}}]}],"footer":"Once saved, type @ and its name at the start of any text field, like @improve.","title":"Custom @ Commands"},{"id":"advanced","fields":[{"id":"configFile","value":"$any","kind":"info","label":"Config file"}],"footer":"Changes apply right away, with no restart.","title":"Advanced"}],"strings":{"action.add":"Add","action.browse":"Open the Library","action.cancel":"Cancel","action.delete":"Delete…","action.hide":"Hide","action.install":"Install","action.remove":"Remove","action.removeKey":"Remove…","action.save":"New…","action.save.item":"Edit…","action.setKey":"Save","action.show":"Show","action.test":"Test","add":"Add…","cancel":"Cancel","choose":"Choose…","confirm.delete":"Delete “{name}”?","confirm.removeItem":"Remove “{name}”?","confirm.removeKey":"Remove “{name}”?","moveDown":"Move down","moveUp":"Move up","paste":"Paste it","remove":"Remove","save":"Save","window.title":"AllInOneIME Settings","working":"Working…"}}}
